/Alt (Flowchart depicting a study involving 109 participants. Data collected includes physiological parameters, altitudes, and demographics. Data preprocessing involves population type, altitude labels, and difference calculation. Analysis branches into overall physiological trends, accuracy assessment, ethnic differences, and acute versus chronic adaptation. Key findings focus on altitude impact, adaptation influence, and ethnic background role.)
